      returns: "A state proportional to u(T), or a history state, together with separately stated matrix-query and initial-state-query complexity.",
      returnsJa: "u(T) に比例する状態、またはヒストリー状態。あわせて行列クエリ数と初期状態クエリ数を別々に示します。",
