    //
    // The two parameter comments are `cost` verbatim -- Theorem 1's
    // "$(1/2^n, n+1)$-block-encoding" of $A$ "when $|a_ij| \leq 1$", and
    // Theorem 2's "$(1/2^n, n+1, N^3\cdot\delta_c)$-block-encoding of $A$ up to
