    //
    // The counts are `cost` and the `repeats` note, in both of the forms the
    // record gives them: the total, "N = O(log(M) · max_i ||O_i − tr(O_i)2^{-n}
    // I||²_shadow / ε²) total measurements to predict M linear functions to
